      "text": "The pronouncements of Kang have heralded the end of human civilization — and the dark powers of the world move to make those prophesies a reality! Fighting a war on three fronts, Earth's Mightiest Heroes are stretched to their limits — while the real threat consolidates his power! But when in doubt, there's one time-tested stratagem: assemble more Avengers!"
